<body>
  <GameNav />
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &gt; <a href="/rooms-and-exits/">Rooms &amp; Exits</a> &gt; Chapter 3 &gt; Level 15</nav>

  <main class="seo-section">
    <h1>Rooms &amp; Exits Chapter 3 Level 15 Walkthrough: Garage</h1>

    <p>Garage is the fifteenth room of Chapter 3, <i>Murder Dressed in White</i>, and it is one of the largest interiors in the chapter. Three cars — a white saloon, a red saloon and a blue saloon — sit on yellow-marked concrete in front of a wall of shelving and two work desks with monitors. The room's information is split between a screen showing three sports cars, a four-letter lock on a yellow panel, and a shape board that changes colour while you watch it. There is no number pad anywhere; the only digits the room shows you are the battery count in your own inventory.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with Webelinx Games, the developer of Rooms &amp; Exits: Escape Room Games.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Rebuilt frame by frame at one frame per second. The four letters on the yellow panel — <b>L</b>, <b>S</b>, <b>Z</b>, <b>A</b> — were read twice, once from the whole frame and once from a tight crop, and both passes agreed with no ambiguous glyphs. Everything that only ever read one way, or that the clip cuts before it resolves, is listed under "What this page could not verify" instead of being printed as a solution.</div>

    <LevelSelector chapter={3} current={15} variant="jump" label="Chapter 3 · Murder Dressed in White" />

    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Garage is room 15 of 24 in Chapter 3. The only code-level read is the four-letter lock at 5:19: <b>L S Z A</b>. The completion banner appears at 5:31, but the clip ends before the reward numbers resolve.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Sweep the room: white, red and blue saloons on yellow lines, shelving along the back wall, two desks with monitors.</li>
        <li>Take the cart at 0:29 — green <b>TECHNOLOGY</b> hardbacks and flat blue rings.</li>
        <li>Read the framed screen at 1:59: a yellow car with raised doors, a red car, a blue car. Those are the three cars in the room.</li>
        <li>Work the shape board at 2:59 and 3:19. Only the leftmost square cycles; the two green squares and the red and green bars do not.</li>
        <li>Collect the batteries — the inventory reads <b>2/2</b> at 3:59.</li>
        <li>Set the four-letter lock: <b>L S Z A</b> at 5:19.</li>
        <li>The banner lands at 5:31 and the file ends at 5:32, so no reward figure is printed here.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="video-wrap">
      <div class="yt-facade" data-yt="SJUnv1xKrjE" data-title="Rooms &amp; Exits Level 15 Garage Walkthrough Murder Dressed in White Chapter 3"
           role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play video: Rooms &amp; Exits Level 15 Garage Walkthrough">
        <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SJUnv1xKrjE/maxresdefault.jpg"
